<title>USA: Resource America files to offer new shrs.</title>
<headline>Resource America files to offer new shrs.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Resource America Inc said on Friday it filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for a proposed offering of 1.4 million new shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The underwriting will be managed by Freidman, Billings, Ramsey &amp; Co Inc, Resource America said.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available for further comment.</p>
<p>The company had about 2.7 million shares outstanding at June 30.</p>
</text>
